        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Jisu, he ai zian liangmei pu,",
            "Nang zauzian 7}$ ai huayney e;",
            "He kaipat kiu tiilou pw ’thei",
            "Nang ta zian dianghmei khou piu ni.",
            "",
            "Baihmei nunc #^7 .. machunh tan diu,",
            "Kachaekc-kaphut ramgai ta kiu!",
            "How gaymei ta .. ai machunh lak,",
            "Nang hei akhang tingkauh kiu the.",
            "",
            "2 Dih tuang ’thuk liangmei ramzian 7}$",
            "Nang ramzian hu khou ramh hamh e,",
            "Rigwnna phaan e, Pou, Nang ta",
            "’Bui nungc ai how ni cho twna.",
            "",
            "3 Paradais khou neihlaa sihni,",
            "How gaymei mwnpwang how sihni,",
            "Tingkauh ramgai #^7 lyn lak ge,",
            "Nang ramzian de akhang ’thukmei.",
            "",
            "4 Nang bam mak ’thei kauh ramgaan #^7",
            "Alung kwn khang gaanclou ngam lak;",
            "Ryanra dic khou sic Nang bam ’thei",
            "Kauh ramneihlaa #^7 padik ge."
          ]
        }
      },
